+// Symmetric-int8 projection with runtime-quantized activations, matching the
+// reference W8A8 scheme: weights carry one float32 scale per output channel,
+// activations one float32 scale per ``group`` channels of every row.
+// Y[m, n] = bf16(bias[n] + sum_g xscale[m, g] * wscale[n] *
+//                sum_{k in g} int(x[m, k]) * int(w[n, k])),
+// where the inner sum is exact in int32 and the group terms accumulate in
+// float32. ``swiglu`` expects w of shape [2N, K] with gate rows first and
+// returns silu(gate) * value in float32 before the single bfloat16 round.
+// Reference: TensorFold MiniMax-H3 kernels (Apache-2.0), re-implemented.
